{"text":"kuruntokai","n":313,"lines":["பெருங்கடற் கரையது சிறுவெண் காக்கை","நீத்துநீர் இருங்கழி இரைதேர்ந் துண்டு","பூக்கமழ் பொதும்பிற் சேக்குந் துறைவனொடு","யாத்தேம் யாத்தன்று நட்பே","அவிழ்த்தற் கரிதது முடிந்தமைந் தன்றே"],"tr":["peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai","nīttunīr iruṅkaḻi iraitērn tuṇṭu","pūkkamaḻ potumpiṟ cēkkun tuṟaivaṉoṭu","yāttēm yāttaṉṟu naṭpē","aviḻttaṟ karitatu muṭintamain taṉṟē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 12, veṇṭaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பெருங்கடற்","tr":"peruṅkaṭaṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருங்","tr":"peruṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடற்","tr":"kaṭaṟ"}]},{"text":"கரையது","tr":"karaiyatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கரை","tr":"karai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யது","tr":"yatu"}]},{"text":"சிறுவெண்","tr":"ciṟuveṇ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"}]},{"text":"காக்கை","tr":"kākkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"காக்","tr":"kāk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]}],[{"text":"நீத்துநீர்","tr":"nīttunīr","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீத்","tr":"nīt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துநீர்","tr":"tunīr"}]},{"text":"இருங்கழி","tr":"iruṅkaḻi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இருங்","tr":"iruṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழி","tr":"kaḻi"}]},{"text":"இரைதேர்ந்","tr":"iraitērn","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரை","tr":"irai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேர்ந்","tr":"tērn"}]},{"text":"துண்டு","tr":"tuṇṭu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"துண்","tr":"tuṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]}],[{"text":"பூக்கமழ்","tr":"pūkkamaḻ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூக்","tr":"pūk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கமழ்","tr":"kamaḻ"}]},{"text":"பொதும்பிற்","tr":"potumpiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொதும்","tr":"potum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிற்","tr":"piṟ"}]},{"text":"சேக்குந்","tr":"cēkkun","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சேக்","tr":"cēk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குந்","tr":"kun"}]},{"text":"துறைவனொடு","tr":"tuṟaivaṉoṭu","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வனொ","tr":"vaṉo"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]}],[{"text":"யாத்தேம்","tr":"yāttēm","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாத்","tr":"yāt"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேம்","tr":"tēm"}]},{"text":"யாத்தன்று","tr":"yāttaṉṟu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாத்","tr":"yāt"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"நட்பே","tr":"naṭpē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நட்","tr":"naṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"}]}],[{"text":"அவிழ்த்தற்","tr":"aviḻttaṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அவிழ்த்","tr":"aviḻt"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தற்","tr":"taṟ"}]},{"text":"கரிதது","tr":"karitatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கரி","tr":"kari"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தது","tr":"tatu"}]},{"text":"முடிந்தமைந்","tr":"muṭintamain","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முடிந்","tr":"muṭin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தமைந்","tr":"tamain"}]},{"text":"தன்றே","tr":"taṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பெருங்கடல்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"perumai","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"கடல்","lemma":"kaṭal","gloss":"sea"}],"gloss":"great sea"},{"surface":"கரையது","parts":[{"text":"கரை","lemma":"karai","gloss":"shore"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"of (genitive)"}],"gloss":"of the shore"},{"surface":"சிறுவெண்","parts":[{"text":"சிறுவெண்","lemma":"சிறுவெண்","gloss":"small white"}],"gloss":"small white","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காக்கை","parts":[{"text":"காக்கை","lemma":"kākkai","gloss":"gull/crow"}],"gloss":"sea-crow/gull"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீத்துநீர்","parts":[{"text":"நீத்து","lemma":"nīttu","gloss":"deep water"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"deep water"},{"surface":"இருங்கழி","parts":[{"text":"இருமை","lemma":"irumai","gloss":"dark/large"},{"text":"கழி","lemma":"kaḻi","gloss":"backwater"}],"gloss":"dark backwater"},{"surface":"இரைதேர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"இரை","lemma":"irai","gloss":"prey"},{"text":"தேர்ந்து","lemma":"tērtal","gloss":"having searched"}],"gloss":"having searched for prey"},{"surface":"உண்டு","parts":[{"text":"உண்டு","lemma":"uṇ","gloss":"having eaten"}],"gloss":"having eaten"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பூக்கமழ்","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"pū","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"கமழ்","lemma":"kamaḻ","gloss":"fragrant"}],"gloss":"flower-fragrant"},{"surface":"பொதும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பொதும்பின்","lemma":"பொதும்பின்","gloss":"in the grove"}],"gloss":"in the grove","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சேக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"சேக்கும்","lemma":"cē","gloss":"roosting/resting"}],"gloss":"roosting"},{"surface":"துறைவனொடு","parts":[{"text":"துறைவன்","lemma":"tuṟaivaṉ","gloss":"lord of the shore"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the lord of the shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாத்தேம்","parts":[{"text":"யா","lemma":"yā","gloss":"bind"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"தேம்","lemma":"ēm","gloss":"we (first person plural)"}],"gloss":"we bound"},{"surface":"யாத்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"யா","lemma":"yā","gloss":"bind"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"aṉṟu","gloss":"it (neuter singular)"}],"gloss":"it is bound"},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பு","lemma":"naṭpu","gloss":"friendship"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"friendship indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அவிழ்த்தற்கு","parts":[{"text":"அவிழ்","lemma":"aviḻ","gloss":"untie"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"increment"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"tal","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to (dative)"}],"gloss":"to untie"},{"surface":"அரிது","parts":[{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"aritu","gloss":"difficult"}],"gloss":"difficult"},{"surface":"அது","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"முடிந்து","parts":[{"text":"முடி","lemma":"muṭi","gloss":"knot/tie"},{"text":"ந்து","lemma":"ntu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having been knotted"},{"surface":"அமைந்தன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"settle/fit"},{"text":"ந்து","lemma":"ntu","gloss":"having"},{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"aṉṟu","gloss":"it (neuter singular)"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"it is settled indeed"}]}],"literal":"Of the great sea shore, the small white gull, / in the deep water of the dark backwater, having searched for prey and eaten, / in the flower-fragrant grove roosts, with the lord of such a shore, / we bound, bound is our friendship! / To untie, it is difficult; that is knotted and settled indeed!","translation":"Our friendship with the lord of the shore—where the small white gull of the great sea-coast seeks and eats its prey in the deep waters of the dark backwater, and then roosts in the flower-fragrant grove—was bound by us, and bound it remains. It is impossible to untie; it is firmly knotted and settled forever.","modern":"பெரிய கடல் கரையைச் சேர்ந்த சிறிய வெண்மையான கடற்காகம், ஆழமான நீரையுடைய கரிய கழியில் தன் இரையைத் தேடித் தின்றுவிட்டு, மலர்கள் மணக்கும் சோலையில் தங்கும் துறைமுகத் தலைவனுடன் நாம் கொண்ட நட்பு, நம்மால் பிணைக்கப்பட்டது; அது உறுதியாகப் பிணைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. அதனை அவிழ்ப்பது அரிது; அது முடிந்து நிலைபெற்றுவிட்டது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her confidante, reassuring her of the unbreakable strength of her love for the hero. The setting belongs to the neytal (coastal) landscape, where a small white sea-gull feeds in the deep, dark backwaters and then finds rest in a fragrant grove. This image of the bird finding refuge mirrors the hero, who finds peace and fulfillment in the heroine's love. The heroine emphasizes that their bond (naṭpu) was mutually bound (yāttēm) and is now a permanent knot. It is described as 'aviḻttaṟku aritu' (impossible to untie), showing her absolute certainty in their relationship despite any temporary separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[2.15,3.2],[3.2,3.68],[3.68,4.19],[4.19,4.5],[4.5,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.4],[6.4,7.15],[7.15,7.75],[7.75,8.5],[8.5,8.9],[8.9,9.65],[9.65,10.4],[10.4,10.7],[10.78,11.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.69],[0.69,1.14],[1.14,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,4.3],[4.3,4.6],[4.6,5.7],[5.7,5.83],[5.95,6.7],[6.7,7.2],[7.2,7.56],[7.56,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,10.2],[10.2,11.0],[11.0,11.9],[11.9,12.2]]},"sync":[[["பெருங்கடல்","great sea"]],[["கரையது","of the shore"]],[["சிறுவெண்","small white"]],[["காக்கை","sea-crow/gull"]],[["நீத்துநீர்","deep water"]],[["இருங்கழி","dark backwater"]],[["இரைதேர்ந்து","having searched for prey"]],[["இரைதேர்ந்து","having searched for prey"],["உண்டு","having eaten"]],[["பூக்கமழ்","flower-fragrant"]],[["பொதும்பின்","in the grove"]],[["சேக்கும்","roosting"]],[["துறைவனொடு","with the lord of the shore"]],[["யாத்தேம்","we bound"]],[["யாத்தன்று","it is bound"]],[["நட்பே","friendship indeed"]],[["அவிழ்த்தற்கு","to untie"]],[["அவிழ்த்தற்கு","to untie"],["அரிது","difficult"],["அது","that"]],[["முடிந்து","having been knotted"],["அமைந்தன்றே","it is settled indeed"]],[["அமைந்தன்றே","it is settled indeed"]]]}